        "subject": "LU-10026 cdsc: update layout compressibility",
        "message": "LU-10026 cdsc: update layout compressibility\n\nWhen compressing write changes the file's compressibility, it updates\nthe file layout flags so that its compressibility persists.\n\nlod: reset la_attr at declare\n\nto avoid unplanned local attributes update during minor layout change.\n\nDDN-bug-id: EX-10786\nWas-Change-Id: I093efeb9cf110adfe6a7590091e60b1e9f1eb9ed\n\nTest-Parameters: forjanitoronly\nDDN-bug-id: EX-8355\nSigned-off-by: Alex Zhuravlev <bzzz@whamcloud.com>\nSigned-off-by: Bobi Jam <bobijam@whamcloud.com>\nSigned-off-by: Marc Vef <mvef@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: Ia2964817d1b5fee2d84ef15e9f1036882d70adb2\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
